📝 Program 1 — Write Text to a File

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to create/open a text file and write data into it using the C++ "ofstream" class.

It introduces the basic concept of file output streams, checks whether the file was opened successfully, writes multiple lines of text, and finally closes the file.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 📂 Creating and opening a text file
- ✍️ Writing data using "ofstream"
- ⚠️ Checking file-opening errors
- 🔒 Closing a file
- 💾 Permanent storage of text data

📁 File Created

"message.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Feature

"std::ofstream"
